      "message": "say that self.get_project.invalidate() fails with an exception, now the tokens aren\u0027t disabled. Seems like this should happen first, or even if those calls failed? The previous behavior was that the tokens were deleted before the project was updated (since it happened in controller).\n\nThis comment applies to delete_project and delete_role. The tokens used to be deleted first, and I think that\u0027s the right way to do it, since it\u0027s a little safer.",
