      "message": "I\u0027m fine with doing that.  However, if invalidate (somehow fails) the project will only be partially disabled and in theory (depending on cache state) there are ways to issue new tokens.  This was to eliminate races on new tokens being issued while project deletion occurred.  \n\nI\u0027ll switch to token deletion first where appropriate.",
